  {"t": "Check the contrast: crisp, tidy ink lines against soft, bleeding colour is the whole idea, and the spiral of dark paint drives the movement round and down onto the city. Media: watercolour + fineliner.", "e": ["<path class=\"ln\" pathLength=\"1\" d=\"M15 384.5H385\" style=\"stroke:#111;stroke-width:2.2\" filter=\"url(#wobble)\"/>"]}
